<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 18 February <span class="n">9</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/berthold-v-duke-of-zahringen"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/berthold-v-duke-of-zahringen.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Berthold V, Duke of Zähringen</span><span class="tp">d. 1218</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/albert-ii-duke-of-mecklenburg"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/albert-ii-duke-of-mecklenburg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Albert II, Duke of Mecklenburg</span><span class="tp">1318–1379</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/hedwig-jagiellon-duchess-of-bavaria"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/hedwig-jagiellon-duchess-of-bavaria.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Hedwig Jagiellon, Duchess of Bavaria</span><span class="tp">1457–1502</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/martin-luther"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/martin-luther.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Martin Luther</span><span class="tp">1483–1546</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/michelangelo"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/michelangelo.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Michelangelo</span><span class="tp">1475–1564</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/william-phips"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/william-phips.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">William Phips</span><span class="tp">1651–1695</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/anna-maria-luisa-de-medici"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/anna-maria-luisa-de-medici.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Anna Maria Luisa de' Medici</span><span class="tp">1667–1743</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/johann-wilhelm-ludwig-gleim"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/johann-wilhelm-ludwig-gleim.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Johann Wilhelm Ludwig Gleim</span><span class="tp">1719–1803</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/dragisa-cvetkovic"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/dragisa-cvetkovic.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Dragiša Cvetković</span><span class="tp">1893–1969</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
